      howToRun: 'Do NOT state the rule first. Pose the question — a fixed promise, so why does the price move — and let the room sit in it, because the puzzlement is what makes the arithmetic land. Then do the 100 / 105 / ten-per-cent sum on a board with the room calling out numbers, and ask afterwards what changed INSIDE the bond. The answer is nothing, and that is the hinge. Let somebody in the room get to the thirty-year case on their own if they can. Close on the two meanings of "safe" — this is the sentence people will carry out of the session — and then read Ecclesiastes 5:4 and 5:5 together.',
